Quasars (0 < z < 5; files quasar_*; Quasar Template thread)
-----------------------------------------------------------

Grid: rest 600-9900 A, 12,175 pixels. Input: every SDSS and DESI quasar with the per-spectrum pass-Q measurements,
1.28 million in the training set. Normalization window 3000-3050 A; luminosity M_AB(3025) = -2.5 log F_abs - 19.81,
F_abs the absolute flux density at 10 pc. Scripts in programs_quasars/ (01/02 pass Q, 04_cells.py, 05_stack.py,
06_empca.py, 12_lum_stacks.py, 13_telluric_export.py, 14_template_rebin.py; launchers run_stack_v3.sh,
after_stack_v3.sh, run_v3_*.sh); logs in ~/data/sdssdesi_status/; products in ~/data/sdssdesi_products/quasar/.
Files here: quasar_eigenspectra_v1*.fits/.png (= qso_empca_v1*.fits of 2026-10-29), quasar_eigenspectra_v2.fits/.png
(= qso_empca_v5.fits of 2026-11-02) and quasar_eigenspectra_v3.fits/.png (= qso_empca_v6.fits of 2026-11-03, the current
basis; *_e0-e9.png shows its first ten vectors). The intermediate bases are in the products directory
